               <extent xml:id="extent_bceadbf8">28 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_b42d9ea3">23.5 x 30.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_36a38b40">Bound with "Guldhornene" (HartW 25). In full cloth binding with handwritten label in Hartmann's hand pasted on front cover inscribed: "Guldhornene - Op: 11 og / Jurabjergene - Op: 14, to Melodramer til Texter af / Oehlenschlæger. / 1832 og 1833. / Partitur.". Written in brown ink with minor corrections. German text added later in different ink. Paper: 14 staves. Paginated 1-26, two last pages blank. At the end of the music on p. 26 dated "d: 16 Febr: 33."</physMedium>
